# Task 4 Report: Immutable Effective Engine Policy and Honest Optimizer Surface

## Status

Complete after fix round 3. The policy now attests the complete optimizer-relevant scoring and
engine-policy surface for the owned built-in implementation. This is an implementation inventory, not a
claim that its thresholds are universal CANSLIM constraints. Injected strategies are truthfully scoped to
the engine-owned envelope plus an optional declared identity; opaque custom internals are explicitly
unattested.

No entry, signal, score, market, sizing, capacity, or exit decision was tuned. The behavior changes are
limited to fail-closed rejection of inert requests and fail-closed policy-attestation boundaries.

